---
comment: "상태창 UI (STATUS_PANEL) + 사이드토글 2개 + 인벤/가챠 사이드패널"
type: editdisplay
ableFlag: true
flag: g<cbs>
---
@@@ IN
\[STATUS_PANEL\]DAY:(\d+)\|HP:(\d+)\|MAXHP:(\d+)\|HPPCT:(\d+)\|MANA:(\d+)\|MAXMANA:(\d+)\|MANAPCT:(\d+)\|HUNGER:(\d+)\|MAXHUNGER:(\d+)\|HUNGERPCT:(\d+)\|POINTS:([^\|]+)\|ATK:(\d+)\|DEF:(\d+)\|LUCK:(\d+)\|ITEMS:([^\|]+)\|SKILLS:([^\|]+)\|RELICS:([^\|]+)\|FACILITIES:([^\|]+)\|COMPANIONS:([^\|]+)\|FLOOR:([^\|]+)\|GATE:([^\|]+)\|STAGE:([^\|]+)\|TIP:([^\[]+)\[\/STATUS_PANEL\]
@@@ OUT
{{#if {{greater_equal::{{chat_index}}::{{? {{lastmessageid}}-5}}}}}}{{#when::{{equal::{{chat_index}}::{{lastmessageid}}}}::is::1}}{{#when::{{and::{{notequal::{{getvar::cv_roundPanel}}::null}}::{{notequal::{{getvar::cv_roundPanel}}::}}}}::is::1}}{{getvar::cv_roundPanel}}{{/when}}{{#when::{{and::{{notequal::{{getvar::cv_monsterPanel}}::null}}::{{notequal::{{getvar::cv_monsterPanel}}::}}}}::is::1}}{{getvar::cv_monsterPanel}}{{/when}}{{/when}}<div class="sys-status-panel"><input type="radio" name="sys-status-cat-{{chat_index}}" id="sys-cat-status-{{chat_index}}" class="sys-cat-radio sys-cat-radio-status" checked><input type="radio" name="sys-status-cat-{{chat_index}}" id="sys-cat-map-{{chat_index}}" class="sys-cat-radio sys-cat-radio-map"><div class="sys-cat-tabs"><label for="sys-cat-status-{{chat_index}}" class="sys-cat-tab sys-cat-tab-status"><span class="sys-cat-tab-icon">📊</span><span>STATUS</span></label><label for="sys-cat-map-{{chat_index}}" class="sys-cat-tab sys-cat-tab-map"><span class="sys-cat-tab-icon">🧭</span><span>MAP</span></label></div><div class="sys-status-cat-content sys-status-cat-status"><div class="sys-status-hdr"><span class="sys-status-hdr-icon">▣</span><span>STATUS PANEL</span></div><div class="sys-top-bar"><div class="sys-status-chip"><span class="sys-chip-icon">📅</span><span class="sys-chip-label">DAY</span><span class="sys-chip-value">$1일차</span></div><div class="sys-status-chip sys-floor-chip"><span class="sys-chip-icon">🏰</span><span class="sys-chip-label">클리어 층</span><span class="sys-chip-value sys-floor-val">$20F</span><span class="sys-chip-sub sys-gate sys-gate-$21"></span></div><div class="sys-status-chip"><span class="sys-chip-icon">🏝</span><span class="sys-chip-label">STAGE</span><span class="sys-chip-value sys-stage-val">$22</span></div><div class="sys-status-chip sys-points-chip"><span class="sys-chip-icon">💰</span><span class="sys-chip-label">POINTS</span><span class="sys-chip-value sys-points-value">$11</span></div></div><div class="sys-gauges-row"><div class="sys-gauge-cell"><div class="sys-gauge-hdr"><span class="sys-gauge-icon">❤️</span><span class="sys-gauge-label">HP</span><span class="sys-gauge-nums">$2 / $3</span></div><div class="sys-gauge-track"><div class="sys-gauge-bar sys-hp-bar" style="width:$4%"></div></div></div><div class="sys-gauge-cell"><div class="sys-gauge-hdr"><span class="sys-gauge-icon">💎</span><span class="sys-gauge-label">MANA</span><span class="sys-gauge-nums">$5 / $6</span></div><div class="sys-gauge-track"><div class="sys-gauge-bar sys-mana-bar" style="width:$7%"></div></div></div><div class="sys-gauge-cell"><div class="sys-gauge-hdr"><span class="sys-gauge-icon">🍖</span><span class="sys-gauge-label">HUNGER</span><span class="sys-gauge-nums">$8 / $9</span></div><div class="sys-gauge-track"><div class="sys-gauge-bar sys-hunger-bar" style="width:$10%"></div></div></div></div><div class="sys-stats-row"><div class="sys-stat sys-stat-atk"><span class="sys-stat-icon">⚔</span><span class="sys-stat-label">ATK</span><span class="sys-stat-value">$12</span></div><div class="sys-stat sys-stat-def"><span class="sys-stat-icon">🛡</span><span class="sys-stat-label">DEF</span><span class="sys-stat-value">$13</span></div><div class="sys-stat sys-stat-luck"><span class="sys-stat-icon">🍀</span><span class="sys-stat-label">LUCK</span><span class="sys-stat-value">$14</span></div></div><div class="sys-companions-row"><div class="sys-companions-label"><span class="sys-companions-icon">👥</span> 동료</div><div class="sys-companions-list">{{#when::{{getvar::cv_companions}}::isnot::None::and::{{getvar::cv_companions}}::isnot::null}}{{#each {{split::{{getvar::cv_companions}}::, }} as comp}}<span class="sys-companion-chip">{{slot::comp}}</span>{{/each}}{{:else}}<span class="sys-companions-empty">아직 없음</span>{{/when}}</div></div><div class="sys-items-row"><div class="sys-items-label"><span class="sys-items-icon">📦</span> 아이템</div><div class="sys-items-list">{{#when::{{contains::{{getvar::cv_itemDetails}}::||}}::is::1}}{{#each {{split::{{getvar::cv_itemDetails}}::;;}} as raw}}<div class="sys-item-card"><div class="sys-item-name">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::0}}</div>{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::3}}::isnot::null}}<div class="sys-item-desc">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::3}}</div>{{/when}}</div>{{/each}}{{:else}}<span class="sys-items-empty">아직 없음</span>{{/when}}</div></div><div class="sys-status-tip"><span class="sys-status-tip-icon">💬</span><span class="sys-status-tip-label">GM</span><div class="sys-status-tip-text">$23</div></div></div><div class="sys-status-cat-content sys-status-cat-map"><div class="sys-map-img-wrap"><img class="sys-map-img" src="{{#when::{{getvar::cv_islandStage}}::is::5}}{{path::map_5}}{{:else}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_islandStage}}::is::4}}{{path::map_4}}{{:else}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_islandStage}}::is::3}}{{path::map_3}}{{:else}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_islandStage}}::is::2}}{{path::map_2}}{{:else}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_islandStage}}::is::1}}{{path::map_1}}{{:else}}{{path::map_0}}{{/when}}{{/when}}{{/when}}{{/when}}{{/when}}" alt="가챠섬 월드맵"><div class="sys-map-region-grid"><button type="button" risu-trigger="exploreNorthMountain" class="sys-map-banner-btn sys-map-banner-north" title="북쪽 산맥 진입"><img class="sys-map-banner-img" src="{{path::northmountain}}" alt="북쪽 산맥 진입"></button><button type="button" risu-trigger="exploreWestForest" class="sys-map-banner-btn sys-map-banner-west" title="서쪽 숲 진입"><img class="sys-map-banner-img" src="{{path::westforest}}" alt="서쪽 숲 진입"></button><button type="button" risu-trigger="exploreEastDesert" class="sys-map-banner-btn sys-map-banner-east" title="동쪽 사막 진입"><img class="sys-map-banner-img" src="{{path::eastdesert}}" alt="동쪽 사막 진입"></button><button type="button" risu-trigger="exploreSouthBeach" class="sys-map-banner-btn sys-map-banner-south" title="남쪽 해변 진입"><img class="sys-map-banner-img" src="{{path::southbeach}}" alt="남쪽 해변 진입"></button><button type="button" risu-trigger="mapGoToSanctuary" class="sys-map-banner-btn sys-map-banner-center" title="중앙 성소 진입"><img class="sys-map-banner-img" src="{{path::centersanctuary}}" alt="중앙 성소 진입"></button><button type="button" risu-trigger="mapEnterDungeon" class="sys-map-banner-btn sys-map-banner-dungeon{{#when::{{or::{{equal::{{getvar::cv_dungeonGateState}}::닫힘}}::{{equal::{{getvar::cv_dungeonGateState}}::도전중}}}}::is::1}} sys-map-disabled{{/when}}" title="던전 게이트 진입 (현재: {{getvar::cv_dungeonGateState}})"><img class="sys-map-banner-img" src="{{path::dungeongate}}" alt="던전 게이트 진입"></button></div></div></div></div>{{#when::{{equal::{{chat_index}}::{{getvar::cv_lastCharMsgId}}}}::or::{{equal::{{chat_index}}::{{lastmessageid}}}}}}<div class="gi-side-container"><input type="radio" name="gi-side" id="gi-side-none" class="gi-side-radio" checked><input type="radio" name="gi-side" id="gi-side-inv" class="gi-side-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invOpen}}::is::1}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-side" id="gi-side-gacha" class="gi-side-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_gachaPanelOpen}}::is::1}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-side" id="gi-side-forge" class="gi-side-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeOpen}}::is::1}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-side" id="gi-side-guide" class="gi-side-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_guideOpen}}::is::1}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-side" id="gi-side-debug" class="gi-side-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_debugOpen}}::is::1}} checked{{/when}}><div class="gi-side-toggles"><label for="gi-side-inv"   class="gi-toggle-btn gi-toggle-inv"   title="인벤토리">🎒</label><label for="gi-side-gacha" class="gi-toggle-btn gi-toggle-gacha" title="가챠">🎰</label><label for="gi-side-forge" class="gi-toggle-btn gi-toggle-forge" title="강화소">🔨</label><label for="gi-side-guide" class="gi-toggle-btn gi-toggle-guide" title="정보 (가이드 + 보조모델 ON/OFF)">📖</label><label for="gi-side-debug" class="gi-toggle-btn gi-toggle-debug" title="디버그/치트 (복구 도구)">🔧</label></div><label for="gi-side-none" class="gi-side-backdrop"></label><div class="gi-side-panel gi-panel-inv"><input type="radio" name="gi-inv-cat" id="gi-inv-bag" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::isnot::skill}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::isnot::relic}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::isnot::facility}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::isnot::companion}} checked{{/when}}{{/when}}{{/when}}{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-inv-cat" id="gi-inv-skill" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::is::skill}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-inv-cat" id="gi-inv-relic" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::is::relic}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-inv-cat" id="gi-inv-facility" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::is::facility}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-inv-cat" id="gi-inv-companion" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_invCategory}}::is::companion}} checked{{/when}}><div class="gi-side-panel-header"><div class="gi-side-panel-title"><span class="gi-side-panel-title-icon">🎒</span><span>INVENTORY</span></div><label class="gi-side-panel-close" for="gi-side-none">✕</label></div><div class="inv-tabs"><label for="gi-inv-bag" class="inv-tab inv-tab-bag"><span class="inv-tab-icon">📦</span><span>차원주머니</span></label><label for="gi-inv-skill" class="inv-tab inv-tab-skill"><span class="inv-tab-icon">✨</span><span>스킬</span></label><label for="gi-inv-relic" class="inv-tab inv-tab-relic"><span class="inv-tab-icon">🏺</span><span>유물</span></label><label for="gi-inv-facility" class="inv-tab inv-tab-facility"><span class="inv-tab-icon">🏛</span><span>건물</span></label><label for="gi-inv-companion" class="inv-tab inv-tab-companion"><span class="inv-tab-icon">👥</span><span>동료</span></label></div><div class="gi-side-panel-body"><div class="inv-content inv-content-bag">{{#when::{{contains::{{getvar::cv_itemDetails}}::||}}::is::1}}<div class="gi-list">{{#each {{split::{{getvar::cv_itemDetails}}::;;}} as raw}}<div class="gi-card gi-card-bag gi-card-tier-{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}">{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::1}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-1">⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::2}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-2">⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::3}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-3">⭐⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::4}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-4">⭐⭐⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::5}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-5">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}<div class="gi-card-name">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::0}}</div><div class="gi-card-desc">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::1}}</div>{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::3}}::isnot::null}}<div class="gi-card-effect">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::3}}</div>{{/when}}</div>{{/each}}</div>{{:else}}<div class="gi-empty">아직 보급품이 없습니다</div>{{/when}}</div><div class="inv-content inv-content-skill">{{#when::{{getvar::cv_skillInvHtml}}::isnot::}}{{getvar::cv_skillInvHtml}}{{:else}}<div class="gi-empty">아직 스킬이 없습니다</div>{{/when}}</div><div class="inv-content inv-content-relic">{{#when::{{getvar::cv_relicInvHtml}}::isnot::}}{{getvar::cv_relicInvHtml}}{{:else}}<div class="gi-empty">아직 유물이 없습니다</div>{{/when}}</div><div class="inv-content inv-content-facility">{{#when::{{contains::{{getvar::cv_facilityDetails}}::||}}::is::1}}<div class="gi-list">{{#each {{split::{{getvar::cv_facilityDetails}}::;;}} as raw}}<div class="gi-card gi-card-facility gi-card-tier-{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}">{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::1}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-1">⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::2}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-2">⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::3}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-3">⭐⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::4}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-4">⭐⭐⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::2}}::is::5}}<span class="gi-card-stars gi-card-stars-5">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</span>{{/when}}<div class="gi-card-name">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::0}}</div><div class="gi-card-desc">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::1}}</div>{{#when::{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::3}}::isnot::null}}<div class="gi-card-effect">{{array_element::{{split::{{slot::raw}}::||}}::3}}</div>{{/when}}</div>{{/each}}</div>{{:else}}<div class="gi-empty">아직 시설이 없습니다</div>{{/when}}</div><div class="inv-content inv-content-companion">{{#when::{{or::{{equal::{{getvar::cv_companionsGrid}}::null}}::{{equal::{{getvar::cv_companionsGrid}}::}}}}::is::0}}{{getvar::cv_companionsGrid}}{{:else}}<div class="gi-empty">아직 동료가 없습니다</div>{{/when}}</div></div></div><div class="gi-side-panel gi-panel-gacha"><div class="gi-side-panel-header"><div class="gi-side-panel-title"><span class="gi-side-panel-title-icon">🎰</span><span>GACHA</span></div><label class="gi-side-panel-close" for="gi-side-none">✕</label></div><div class="gi-side-panel-body"><div class="gi-gacha-pts-row"><div class="gi-gacha-pts-left"><span class="gi-gacha-pts-icon">💰</span><span class="gi-gacha-pts-label">POINTS</span></div><span class="gi-gacha-pts-value">{{getvar::cv_points}}P</span></div><div class="gi-gacha-grid"><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-companion"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">👥</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">동료 소환</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">5,000P</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row">{{button::가챠::gachaCompanion}}</div></div><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-relic"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">🏺</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">유물 획득</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">3,000P</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row">{{button::가챠::gachaRelic}}</div></div><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-facility"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">🏛</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">시설 건설</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">10,000P</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row">{{button::가챠::gachaFacility}}</div></div><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-skill"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">✨</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">스킬 습득</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">2,000P</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row">{{button::가챠::gachaSkill}}</div></div><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-supply"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">📦</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">보급품</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">200P</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row gi-gacha-btn-split">{{button::1회::gachaSupply}}{{button::2회::gachaSupplyTwice}}</div></div><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-couple"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">💞</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">커플 아이템</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">1,000P</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row">{{button::가챠::gachaCouple}}</div></div><div class="gi-gacha-cell gi-gc-random"><div class="gi-gacha-cell-icon">🎲</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-name">랜덤 가챠</div><div class="gi-gacha-cell-cost">티켓</div><div class="gi-gacha-btn-row gi-gacha-btn-split">{{button::1회::gachaRandom}}{{button::전부::gachaRandomAll}}</div></div></div><div class="gi-gacha-foot">사이드 패널에서 가챠를 진행하세요</div></div></div><div class="gi-side-panel gi-panel-forge"><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-cat" id="gi-forge-skill" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeCategory}}::isnot::relic}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeCategory}}::isnot::facility}} checked{{/when}}{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-cat" id="gi-forge-relic" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeCategory}}::is::relic}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-cat" id="gi-forge-facility" class="gi-cat-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeCategory}}::is::facility}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-slot" id="gi-forge-slot-none" class="gi-forge-slot-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeActiveSlot}}::isnot::1}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeActiveSlot}}::isnot::2}}{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeActiveSlot}}::isnot::3}} checked{{/when}}{{/when}}{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-slot" id="gi-forge-slot-1" class="gi-forge-slot-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeActiveSlot}}::is::1}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-slot" id="gi-forge-slot-2" class="gi-forge-slot-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeActiveSlot}}::is::2}} checked{{/when}}><input type="radio" name="gi-forge-slot" id="gi-forge-slot-3" class="gi-forge-slot-radio"{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeActiveSlot}}::is::3}} checked{{/when}}><div class="gi-side-panel-header" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0044cc 0%, #007aff 50%, #0044cc 100%); border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6600;"><div class="gi-side-panel-title" style="color: #ffffff;"><span class="gi-side-panel-title-icon">🔨</span><span>강화소</span></div><label class="gi-side-panel-close" for="gi-side-none" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-color: #ffffff; color: #ffffff;">✕</label></div><div class="gi-side-panel-body"><div class="gi-forge-tabs"><label for="gi-forge-skill" class="gi-forge-tab gi-forge-tab-skill">✨ 스킬</label><label for="gi-forge-relic" class="gi-forge-tab gi-forge-tab-relic">🏺 유물</label><label for="gi-forge-facility" class="gi-forge-tab gi-forge-tab-facility">🏛 시설</label></div><div class="gi-forge-help">빈 슬롯을 눌러 보유 아이템을 선택하세요. <b>같은 ⭐ 3개</b>를 모으면 한 등급 강화. 5★은 강화 불가. 탭을 바꾸면 각 카테고리의 슬롯이 표시됩니다.</div><div class="gi-forge-slots-tri gi-forge-slots-skill"><label for="gi-forge-slot-1" class="gi-forge-slot gi-forge-slot-pos-1">{{#when::{{getvar::cv_forgeSlotSkill1}}::isnot::null::and::{{getvar::cv_forgeSlotSkill1}}::isnot::}}<span class="gi-forge-slot-name">{{array_el